                                </div>
                                <div class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.6rem;">
                                    <div><strong>Vehicle:</strong> Location-C Frigo #3</div>
                                    <div><strong>Sensor Hardware:</strong> ApexThermal-PRO (Serial: <code>S-99100</code>)</div>
                                    <div><strong>Protocol:</strong> Modbus RTU / RS485</div>
